      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey can u help me out? im writing a piece for my column on the history of public health mandates. i need a quick summary of the main arguments used by scientists vs the arguments from civil liberties advocates regarding mandatory vaccine protocols. just want to make sure i cover the core points of the debate.",
